  "construction_definitions": {
    "candidate_rule": "For either mapped vinyl pair29–33 or31–35, take each aryl ipso neighbour and enumerate their two ortho neighbours; propose new C–C bond between those ortho sites, with valence-consistent dihydro closure. Enumerate both symmetry-inequivalent closures and continue every retained first-layer constitution into the second stage. Oxidation removes the two hydrogens on the newly joined aromatic carbons and restores aromatic bond order; record their maps and H2 reservoir."
  }
